.TH V2_LEN 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
v2_len \- Length (magnitude) of a: sqrt(x*x + y*y)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqmathx.h\(dq
.BI "float v2_len(Vec2 a);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Length (magnitude) of a: sqrt(x*x + y*y). Speed of a velocity, distance of a displacement. Involves a square root; compare squared lengths (v2_dot(a, a)) when only ordering matters.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
the length.
.SH MODULE
math (src/engine/math/mathx.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR v2_dist (3),
.BR v2_norm (3),
.BR v2_dot (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
